.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.8.dev (69fb4a815) - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.16.1088) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-12700H (20 threads) - 15.69 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nMentioned in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119638.\nRelated to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119594.\n\nWhen right-clicking the root node of an unsaved inherited scene, the \"Open in Editor\" button (in the scene tree context menu) is not available. The button only becomes available after the scene is saved.\n\nI can open a PR if needed.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a new scene and save as `test.tscn`.\n2. Right-click `test.tscn` in `FileSystem` tab, click \"New Inherited Scene\", and DO NOT save it.\n3. In the `[unsaved](*)` inherited scene, right-click the root node, and see that the \"Open in Editor\" button is not in the context menu.\n4. Save the inherited scene as `test_inherited.tscn`, right-click the root node, and see that the \"Open in Editor\" button is shown in the context menu.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[MRP_Open_In_Editor_Button.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30938930/MRP_Open_In_Editor_Button.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs